+### Statement descriptors 
 
-(Optional) Customer returns back to the business’s site for payment confirmation
+Set `statement_descriptor` to specify the descriptor Stripe sends for an EPS payment. The value shown on the customer’s bank statement varies by bank. Non-card payments use `statement_descriptor`, while `statement_descriptor_suffix` applies only to card payments. If you don’t set a payment-level descriptor, Stripe uses the account-level statement descriptor.
 
-## Get started
+For Connect destination charges, Stripe uses the platform’s statement descriptor by default. If you set `on_behalf_of`, Stripe uses the connected account’s statement descriptor instead. Learn more about [statement descriptors with Connect](https://docs.stripe.com/connect/statement-descriptors.md).
 
